# Prisma Conventions

## Schema location
`apps/web/prisma/schema.prisma`

## Required fields on every model
```prisma
model Example {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
}
```

## pgvector embedding fields
```prisma
// For any model storing embeddings:
embedding Unsupported("vector(768)")?  // nomic-embed-text = 768 dimensions

@@index([embedding], type: Hnsw(m: 16, efConstruction: 64))
```

## Migration workflow
```bash
# After schema changes:
pnpm --filter web prisma migrate dev --name descriptive-name
pnpm --filter web prisma generate
```

## Never use `prisma.findMany` without pagination in API routes
```ts
// ✅
await prisma.vocabulary.findMany({ take: 50, skip: offset, where: { userId } })
// ❌
await prisma.vocabulary.findMany({ where: { userId } })
```

## WeaknessMap scores are JSON — always validate shape before write
Import `WeaknessMapSchema` from `@dutch-kis/types` before updating.
